irdik", "fr": "Nous l'avons ramené", "id": "Kami mengembalikannya", "ur": "ہم نے اسے لوٹا دیا", "bn": "আমরা তাকে ফিরিয়ে দিয়েছি", "fa": "او را بازگرداندیم"}}], "ayatFile": "ayat/0110.json", "ayatTranslations": {"en": "ayat/0110.en.json", "tr": "ayat/0110.tr.json", "ur": "ayat/0110.ur.json", "id": "ayat/0110.id.json"}, "sentences": [{"arabic": "رَدُّوا التَّحِيَّةَ", "spoken": "audio/83dceda4d1d0242d3f7e.m4a", "tense": "past", "pronoun": "hum", "translation": {"bs": "Uzvratili su pozdrav.", "en": "They returned the greeting.", "bn": "তারা সালামের জবাব দিল।", "fa": "سلام را پاسخ دادند.", "fr": "Ils ont rendu le salut.", "id": "Mereka membalas salam.", "tr": "Selamı geri verdiler.", "ur": "انہوں نے سلام کا جواب دیا۔"}, "independentlyReviewed": true, "words": [{"arabic": "رَدُّوا", "target": true, "translation": {"bs": "uzvratili su", "en": "they returned", "bn": "তারা ফিরিয়ে দিল", "fa": "پاسخ دادند", "fr": "ont rendu", "id": "mereka mengembalikan", "tr": "geri verdiler", "ur": "انہوں نے لوٹایا"}}, {"arabic": "التَّحِيَّةَ", "target": false, "translation": {"bs": "pozdrav", "en": "the greeting", "bn": "সালাম", "fa": "سلام", "fr": "le salut", "id": "salam", "tr": "selam", "ur": "سلام"}}]}, {"arabic": "رَدَّ الْوَلَدُ الْكِتَابَ", "spoken": "audio/dd72a63cfea7d7a4d078.m4a", "tense": "past", "pronoun": "huwa", "translation": {"bs": "Dječak je vratio knjigu.", "en": "The boy returned the book.", "bn": "ছেলেটি বইটি ফেরত দিল।", "fa": "پسر کتاب را پس داد.", "fr": "Le garçon a rendu le livre.", "id": "Anak laki-laki itu mengembalikan buku.", "tr": "Oğlan kitabı geri verdi.", "ur": "لڑکے نے کتاب واپس کر دی۔"}, "independentlyReviewed": true, "words": [{"arabic": "رَدَّ", "target": true, "translation": {"bs": "vratio je", "en": "returned", "bn": "ফিরিয়ে দিল", "fa": "پس داد", "fr": "a rendu", "id": "mengembalikan", "tr": "geri verdi", "ur": "اس نے لوٹایا"}}, {"arabic": "الْوَلَدُ", "target": false, "translation": {"bs": "dječak", "en": "the boy, child", "bn": "ছেলে, শিশু", "fa":